'''Splitnir the Primal''' is the upgraded form of [[Splitnir]] using the [[Jade]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Jade]], they gain 10 [[Poison|poison damage]] and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply [[Immobilized]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

An upgraded Splitnir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Primal.

